<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-sub">请在下方区域手写签名，确认本次服务已完成</view>
    <canvas
      id="sigCanvas"
      class="sig-canvas"
      disable-scroll="true"
      bindtouchstart="onTouchStart"
      bindtouchmove="onTouchMove"
      binderror="onCanvasError"
    ></canvas>
    <view class="sig-actions">
      <view class="mini-btn" bindtap="clearCanvas">重写</view>
    </view>
    <view class="sig-tip" wx:if="{{!hasSig}}">尚未签名</view>
    <view class="sig-tip ok" wx:else>已签名，可提交</view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{submitting}}">提交签名</button>

  <view class="legal">
    电子签名与手写签名具有同等法律效力；签名图片将作为服务履约凭证存档。
  </view>
</view>
